  One substantive note regardless: this incident is itself evidence for the
  branch. A stuck [3mdelivery[0m[39m[49m observation making a demonstrably idle session
  permanently unsendable is the same predict-before-acting failure as the
  pane-scrape gate — and [97m50e66ee[39m does not fix it, because [97mcanAttemptSend[39m still
  returns false on a blocking/busy read without any bound. Worth adding to the
  scope: the delivery-pending gate needs the same bounded fail-open treatment.

